{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"text\": \"轻松退去后，他还记得那一步确实让自己重新动起来，所以仍愿意坚持。\",\n      \"key\": \"重新动起来\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他真尝过那份亲近带来的快乐，当时的坚定也有他努力撑住自己的成分，可眼下不安没让他认定那一步错了。\",\n      \"key\": \"亲近带来的快乐\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕停下就得承认那份亲近回不到从前，便硬撑着把自己催得停不住，脑子反复追问过去还能怎样。\",\n      \"key\": \"催得停不住\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"text\": \"这一步确实有用，可他还想要那种不用防备的亲近，光靠坚持仍没法让他安心。\",\n      \"key\": \"光靠坚持\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R14\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留决定曾让他从犹豫里动起来、所以仍愿坚持的事实。用轻松退去后决定重新浮现的经历承接，并回指先前的行动选择及行动带来的力量。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R15\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧日亲近带来的快乐是真实的、当时的坚定也含有努力支撑自己的成分、眼下不安并未让他否定那一步。去掉工整的反向论证，改为他自己的具体想法。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R16\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"补足并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的另一个要求具体化为害怕亲近回不到从前。同一恐惧解释他为何硬撑着催自己向前、身体仿佛停不下来、思绪又反复追问过去，并接回先前察觉失落后急着劝自己撑住的习惯。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R17\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"找回并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"明确恢复行动确实有用、却不足以满足他对不用防备的亲近的需要。保留行动值得与行动不够这两个判断，不把行动的限度缩成单纯带不回过去。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "016dac78-0db9-4bfe-a559-7e7844c99fd1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T171708836375Z", "elapsed_seconds": 685.359, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T17:28:34.198634+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d8ada3e1474d5ce050b2390ca2db6dbcb3a80f7a8152fdb6b229361a66b3be1e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\